{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"香农·core-contributions","stage":"DONE","category":"claude-shannon","categoryLabel":"香农","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/19_claude-shannon/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核心贡献\">核心贡献</h1><p>本卷回答一个问题：克劳德·香农（一九一六—二〇〇一）到底<strong>做出了什么</strong>，使他既被称为「信息论之父」，又被视为数字时代的奠基者之一。我们不讲他的生平，也不罗列荣誉，而是把他三项最硬核的贡献逐一拆到「有公式、有数字、有例子、有边界」的程度——创立信息论、发明比特与熵、用布尔代数奠定数字电路。</p>\n<p><strong>目标读者</strong>：想真正搞懂「信息论到底说了什么」的学生、工程师与好奇者。<strong>前置</strong>：高中数学（对数、概率）即可；遇到熵的公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H=-\\sum p_i\\log_2 p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不必紧张，本卷会用抛硬币的例子讲透。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工边界\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工边界</h2><p>香农 hub 共六卷，彼此不重复。本卷（核心贡献）专注「成果本身的技术内核」，其余各卷各管一段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>它回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>香农是个怎样的人、何时何地做了这些</td>\n<td>提供本卷成果的<strong>时间与情境</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>核心贡献（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td>他做出的成果，技术上是什么</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想方法</a></td>\n<td>他「怎么想」才得出这些</td>\n<td>本卷讲「是什么」，那卷讲「怎么想出来的」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">代表作</a></td>\n<td>那两篇论文的版本、流传与评价</td>\n<td>本卷讲论文的<strong>内容</strong>，那卷讲论文作为<strong>作品</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>这些成果后来重塑了什么</td>\n<td>本卷讲「成果」，那卷讲「后果」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>误用、争论与总体定位</td>\n<td>为本卷的成果提供批判性视角</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>想知道他做了什么，读本卷；想知道他怎么想的，去思想方法卷；想知道带来了什么后果，去影响与遗产卷。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构与推荐学习路径\">三章结构与推荐学习路径</h2><p>三章按「从奠基到落地」递进，建议顺序阅读：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    C1[第一章&lt;br/&gt;创立信息论] --&gt; C2[第二章&lt;br/&gt;比特与熵]&#10;    C2 --&gt; C3[第三章&lt;br/&gt;数字基础]&#10;    C1 -.历史定位.-&gt; A[信息论之父 + 1948 论文]&#10;    C2 -.核心工具.-&gt; B[比特 + 熵公式]&#10;    C3 -.硬件地基.-&gt; D[布尔电路 + 双重奠基]\">graph LR\n    C1[第一章&lt;br/&gt;创立信息论] --&gt; C2[第二章&lt;br/&gt;比特与熵]\n    C2 --&gt; C3[第三章&lt;br/&gt;数字基础]\n    C1 -.历史定位.-&gt; A[信息论之父 + 1948 论文]\n    C2 -.核心工具.-&gt; B[比特 + 熵公式]\n    C3 -.硬件地基.-&gt; D[布尔电路 + 双重奠基]</pre><ol>\n<li><strong><a href=\"founding-information-theory/\">创立信息论</a></strong>：先确立「为什么是之父」与那篇 1948 论文的整体框架——看全局。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"the-bit-and-entropy/\">比特与熵</a></strong>：再钻进核心工具，搞懂信息怎么用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\log_2 p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 度量、熵为何是中心量——抓工具。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"digital-foundations/\">数字基础</a></strong>：最后看布尔代数如何奠定数字硬件，并把「信息侧 + 硬件侧」合成「双重奠基」——落到地面。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>最短路径</strong>（只想抓主干）：<a href=\"founding-information-theory/the-father-of-information-theory\">信息论之父</a> → <a href=\"the-bit-and-entropy/quantifying-information\">度量信息</a> → <a href=\"digital-foundations/foundations-of-digital-age\">数字时代的基础</a>。</p>\n<p>读完本卷，建议接着读 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想方法</a>（理解方法）或 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>（理解后果）。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"founding-information-theory","title":"创立信息论","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/founding-information-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-father-of-information-theory","title":"信息论之父","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/founding-information-theory/the-father-of-information-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-mathematical-theory-of-communication","title":"《通信的数学理论》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/founding-information-theory/a-mathematical-theory-of-communication"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-bit-and-entropy","title":"比特与信息熵","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/the-bit-and-entropy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantifying-information","title":"度量信息","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/the-bit-and-entropy/quantifying-information"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-concept-of-entropy","title":"信息熵的概念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/the-bit-and-entropy/the-concept-of-entropy"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-foundations","title":"数字基础","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/digital-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"boolean-algebra-and-circuits","title":"布尔代数与开关电路","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/digital-foundations/boolean-algebra-and-circuits"},{"seq":2,"slug":"foundations-of-digital-age","title":"数字时代的基础","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/digital-foundations/foundations-of-digital-age"}]}]}